Examples 4 aur 5 se ek pattern nikalta hai. (Polynomial)/(polynomial) ki limit \(x \to \pm\infty\) par degrees (sab se bari powers) compare kar ke andaza ho jata hai:
1. numerator ki degree < denominator ki degree: limit 0 (Example 5);
2. degrees barabar: limit = leading coefficients ka ratio. Misaal: \(\lim_{x\to\infty}\frac{3x^{2}+1}{x^{2}-5} = \frac{3}{1} = 3\);
3. numerator ki degree > denominator ki degree: fraction beghair had barhta ya ghat'ta hai, limit \(+\infty\) ya \(-\infty\) (Example 4).
Dhyan dein: yeh pattern sirf apna jawab check karne ke liye hai. Paper mein division wala poora tareeqa likhna zaroori hai.
